<title>JAPAN: Meisei Industrial - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Meisei Industrial - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.16		vs	   15.04</p>
<p> Operating	    1.31		vs	  711 million</p>
<p> Current		1.26		vs	  610 million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1.88		vs	prft 314 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 31.37 yen	  vs     prft 5.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares		60 million	 vs	   60 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Meisei Industrial Co Ltd is an engineering company specialising in thermal insulation.</p>
